License
The Field Health mod (scripts, textures, labels, icons, artwork and texts) by MatrikSky is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
You are free to copy, share, modify and publish your own versions of this mod, provided that you:
- clearly credit MatrikSky as the author of the original "Field Health" mod (ideally with a link to the original),
- state that you made changes,
- keep the credits and licences of the authors of the models used.
Exceptions not covered by this licence:
- the MST logo and the likenesses of Bronczek and Jankus on the MST labels are used with permission of the MST crew; remove them or get your own permission before publishing your version,
- the models "fertilizer Bottle" (shabanimate) and "#6 Plastic Canister" (hoxsvl) remain under their authors' CC BY 4.0 licence,
- the Barlow fonts are licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1,
- Farming Simulator and game content belong to GIANTS Software.

